glimpse-media-viewer (1.0.6) noble; urgency=medium

  * Keep the close button in view in a narrow window: the sidebar, then the
    second folder, get narrower to make room, and go back to their own
    widths when the window is wider again. With the second folder showing,
    the window keeps the width it needs; below 800 pixels the sidebar slides
    over the picture.

